#: characters/templates/characters/thanks.html:9
msgid ""
"Most of fungalcharacters.org’s characters began with <strong>nolo_mode</"
"strong>’s list “Characters With Taxonomic Value For Stipitate-Lamellate "
"Mushrooms”, first posted on Mushroom Observer in 2019; a shorter version is "
"the iNaturalist guide “Intro To Identifying Fungi”. <strong>nolo_mode</"
"strong> gave permission to use it in November 2026. <strong>nolo_mode</"
"strong> has also started myceliome.com, a mushroom community for the people "
"of Thailand (open to visitors in Thailand)."
msgstr ""

#: characters/templates/characters/thanks.html:11
msgid ""
"<strong>nolo_mode</strong> in turn credits the people and places the list "
"grew from:"
msgstr ""

#: characters/templates/characters/thanks.html:13
msgid ""
"<strong class=\"thanks-name\">Gastón Guzmán</strong> (1932–2016), Mexican "
"mycologist, whose literature shaped it."
msgstr ""

#: characters/templates/characters/thanks.html:14
msgid ""
"<strong class=\"thanks-name\">Alan Rockefeller</strong>, through personal "
"correspondence."
msgstr ""

#: characters/templates/characters/thanks.html:15
msgid ""
"<strong class=\"thanks-name\">Else Vellinga</strong>, for her glossary in "
"<cite>Flora Agaricina Neerlandica</cite> vol. 1 (Bas, Kuyper, Noordeloos "
"&amp; Vellinga, eds, 1988), which <strong>nolo_mode</strong> recommends to "
"others."
msgstr ""

#: characters/templates/characters/thanks.html:16
msgid ""
"<strong class=\"thanks-name\">Mushroom Observer</strong>, where the list was "
